# TSOA Documentation for Controllers

- Always use Context7 MCP with library `/lukeautry/tsoa` when operating on files in `backend/src/controllers`
- Use Context7 to query TSOA documentation for:
  - Route decorators (@Route, @Get, @Post, @Put, @Delete, etc.)
  - Request and response decorators (@Body, @Query, @Path, @Header, etc.)
  - Response types and status codes
  - Validation and security decorators
  - OpenAPI/Swagger annotations
  - Controller best practices
  - Error handling patterns
  - Middleware integration
